{"book":"1timothy","num":3,"verses":[{"en":"This is a true saying, If a man desire the office of a bishop, he desireth a good work.","n":1,"sm":"O le galuega ma le amioga a epikopo ma tiakono O le upu moni lenei: Afai e naunau se tasi i le faiva o le epikopo, e manao o ia i le galuega lelei.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"galuega"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"amioga"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"epikopo"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"tiakono"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"upu"},{"en":"","sm":"moni"},{"en":"","sm":"lenei:"},{"en":"","sm":"Afai"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"naunau"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"tasi"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"faiva"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"epikopo,"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"manao"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"galuega"},{"en":"","sm":"lelei."}]},{"en":"A bishop then must be blameless, the husband of one wife, vigilant, sober, of good behaviour, given to hospitality, apt to teach;","n":2,"sm":"O lenei, e tatau i le epikopo ia le mataʻuleagaina, o lē faiavā i le fafine e toatasi, o lē faautauta, o lē mafaufau, o lē amio mamalu, o lē alofa i tagata ese, o le na te mafaia ona aʻoaʻo atu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"lenei,"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"tatau"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"epikopo"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"mataʻuleagaina,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"lē"},{"en":"","sm":"faiavā"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"fafine"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"toatasi,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"lē"},{"en":"","sm":"faautauta,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"lē"},{"en":"","sm":"mafaufau,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"lē"},{"en":"","sm":"amio"},{"en":"","sm":"mamalu,"},{"en":"","